Access policyUsage policy <p>Only active Catena-X members who signed the data exchange governance framework see the offer.</p> <pre><code>{
  "@context": [
    "https://w3id.org/dspace/2025/1/odrl-profile.jsonld",
    "https://w3id.org/catenax/2025/9/policy/context.jsonld",
    { "@vocab": "https://w3id.org/edc/v0.0.1/ns/" }
  ],
  "@type": "PolicyDefinition",
  "@id": "access-members",
  "policy": {
    "@type": "Set",
    "permission": [{
      "action": "access",
      "constraint": [{
        "and": [
          { "leftOperand": "Membership", "operator": "eq", "rightOperand": "active" },
          { "leftOperand": "FrameworkAgreement", "operator": "eq", "rightOperand": "DataExchangeGovernance:1.0" }
        ]
      }]
    }]
  }
}
</code></pre> <p>Data may be used under the governance framework, for quality notifications only.</p> <pre><code>{
  "@context": [
    "https://w3id.org/dspace/2025/1/odrl-profile.jsonld",
    "https://w3id.org/catenax/2025/9/policy/context.jsonld",
    { "@vocab": "https://w3id.org/edc/v0.0.1/ns/" }
  ],
  "@type": "PolicyDefinition",
  "@id": "usage-quality",
  "policy": {
    "@type": "Set",
    "permission": [{
      "action": "use",
      "constraint": {
        "and": [
          { "leftOperand": "FrameworkAgreement", "operator": "eq", "rightOperand": "DataExchangeGovernance:1.0" },
          { "leftOperand": "UsagePurpose", "operator": "isAnyOf", "rightOperand": ["cx.core.qualityNotifications:1"] }
        ]
      }
    }]
  }
}
</code></pre> <p>The <code>@context</code> <code>https://w3id.org/catenax/2025/9/policy/context.jsonld</code> lets you write short names such as <code>Membership</code>. They expand to IRIs in the <code>https://w3id.org/catenax/2025/9/policy/</code> namespace.</p>
